# here, as one public key per line ("ssh-ed25519 AAAA... comment"), with a
# comment line above it saying when and why. A key listed here is refused
# whatever date its tag claims, for release tags and for image SHA256SUMS.
#
# Like allowed_signers, this file counts as of the release a site last
# verified: the release that adds a key here is signed by another key, and the
# revocation holds from the next release on. Release it as an urgent fix.
